e “won’t be around very long” if he is not willing to make a peace deal.\n\n🔥Scorched-earth on Zelensky🔥 https://t.co/xozrah1Vdl"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2108870298984386560"],"media_source_tweet_id":["2108870315346436175"]},"author_id":"41427221","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:22:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108956308032360684"],"id":"2108956308032360684","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":32432,"like_count":517,"quote_count":16,"reply_count":233,"retweet_count":172},"text":"President Trump strikes a deal with Russia for diesel fuel...hours later Ukraine blows up the refineries. \n\nDespite Trump telling them weeks ago to stop hitting the refineries. \n\nZelenskyy had earned some good grace with Trump. Now he pissed it all away. \n\nI'm willing to bet this"},{"author_id":"1083736040538628097","created_at":"2026-10-10T20:16:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109015300783898690"],"id":"2109015300783898690","in_reply_to_user_id":"1367531","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108969877302120728","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@FoxNews We know..\n\nTrump wanted to end the war within 24 hours. But Ukraine didn't want to submit to Russia. \n\nAnd now the toddler in charge is angry and is victim blaming. \n\nZero surprises.."},{"author_id":"3131144855","created_at":"2026-10-10T19:23:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109001821687853171"],"id":"2109001821687853171","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":526,"impression_count":636264,"like_count":18900,"quote_count":479,"reply_count":4175,"retweet_count":2954},"text":"It is sickening that the USA is now lifting sanctions on Russian fuel, and transparently ridiculous to blame Ukraine for the spike in prices that obviously began with the closure of the Strait of Hormuz. Putin is murdering innocent Ukrainian civilians every day. The Ukrainians"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["